<p><a href="https://anc.ca.apm.activecommunities.com/ottawa/activity/search?onlineSiteId=0&amp;locale=en-US&amp;activity_select_param=2&amp;center_ids=358&amp;viewMode=list"><span>Check out the courses and camps offered at this facility.</span></a></p>
